  "facility_total": 412,
  "site_total": 13,
  "note": "Two different counts, deliberately not added together. A facility is an EPA ECHO record: a federal agency reports that a Clean Air Act permitted facility carries a hosting NAICS code, and Helios repeats that. A site is Helios's own hypothesis that a set of parcels forms one development, built from county parcel geometry and ownership and defensible line by line. Building sites needs parcel and ownership records, which are published county by county or not at all, so sites exist only where Helios reads a county. A state with facilities and no sites is unread, not empty, and no count here should be taken as the number of data centres in a state."
